    "note": "Both 2/1: 42*32*11 - 36*26*8 = 7296, wall pulled 2: + 42*11*2 = 8220. Both 2/2: 44*34*12 - 36*26*8 = 10464, the wall (now at y = -2, 44 x 12) pulled 2: + 1056 = 11520. Before the QA fix the Press Pull lost its face (FreeCAD's names of the two joined walls changed with every thickness)."
